//! uvwasi, compiled into every executable that depends on this package. uvwasi is built against
//! `uvwasi/shim/uv.h` and not against libuv: the header names each libuv function that uvwasi
//! calls `silk_uvwasi_*`, and the executable must define those symbols. The SilkJS runtime does,
//! in its `ext.uvwasi_host` module. This module only gives the package a module to export.
